 "remarks": "Charm and character abound in this beautifully remodeled English Garden condo! This spacious 2BR/2BA residence blends timeless pre-war architecture with thoughtful modern updates, featuring 9+ ft ceilings and oversized windows overlooking the building's lush, picturesque courtyards. Tucked away behind ivy-covered walls in the heart of downtown Stamford, this distinctive building offers a setting unlike any other. Step inside to a recently remodeled kitchen featuring white shaker cabinetry, gas cooking, and a dishwasher. Architectural details continue into the generously sized living room with built-in bookshelves and crown molding, complemented by a separate formal dining area. The spacious primary bedroom offers two large closets and a private full bath, while the second bedroom features excellent closet space and convenient access to the updated hall bath. Additional highlights include newer wall-to-wall carpeting and heat and hot water included in the common charges. Laundry is conveniently located in the lower level. Ample open parking is available, with garage parking offered for an additional fee. Enjoy a short walk to downtown Stamford's restaurants, shopping, and nightlife, with Metro-North and major highways just minutes away.",
